"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"15358","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332776.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"L'ora del demone","synopsis":"In the crime filled city of Tokyo another mysterious death has occurred, where a high school girl was literally drained of all the moisture in her body and she happens to be the 5th most recent victim. In the darkness of the night what seems to be happening is that the dead are coming back to life, as zombie-like creatures. In Magami High School, five students who barely even talk to each other in school, ban together to get rid of these “Returned Dead” and any of those that may control them. These five students including; transfer student Tatsuma Hiyuu and delinquent Kyouichi Horaiji each have their own special abilities to combat this growing problem.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"15357","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332777.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Odio sotto i petali di ciliegio all'inizio di primavera","synopsis":"Two months ago in Magami High School, the students await the arrival of the transfer student however someone seems to feel uneasy when he arrives. It doesn't take long for the transfer student to get into a little scuffle with the class delinquent Kyouichi, but this may have just been a way for him to introduce himself. Later, for some unknown reason the captain of the Wrestling Club, Yuuya Daigo challenges the new transfer student Tatsuma Hiyuu. With Kyouichi as a witness, they intend to fight it out in an old abandoned part of the school but it doesn't go according to plan as weird things start happening. Meanwhile, some pieces of artwork that are a part of the \"Ten Holy Treasures\" were stolen.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"15366","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332778.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Poteri disumani","synopsis":"The five students are now aware of their mysterious powers, which they gain from fighting the demon in the old school building. Summer break is coming up and everyone seems to be looking forward to it, yet Aoi isn't that excited as everyone else is, following the events that took place in the old school building. The man who saved them, Hisui Kisaragi wants them all to continue with their lives as if nothing happened however they can't just ignore the growing number of murders occuring in the city involving demons. Things get a little intense, as out of know where someone else with mysterious powers blames them for the crow incident, forcing them all into a fight.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"15355","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332779.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"La riunione","synopsis":"The story begins where it left off with; Kyouichi, Komaki and Yuuya left incapacitated by the mysterious man with lightning powers. Tatsuma was able to stop his attack but before anything else could happen he notices some music in the background and it's seems to be coming from the person he was really after. It turns out that the person who's the cause of all the crow incidents is Ryouichi, the lead guitarist of a band known as \"CROW\" and it's his partner, Raito who is trying to stop him. Will Raito be able to save his friends heart from being consumed by evil?","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"15367","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332780.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Sogno infernale","synopsis":"It doesn't take long for more strange incidents to come about, now more high schoolers are falling victim to some kind of curse, where they end up on a coma state or even die. It seems as though the same person who gave Ryouichi powers is pulling the strings again and it seems as though the victims are somehow connected with one another. Meanwhile the gang are back at Kisaragi's antique shop discussing the events of the previous night when the boy transformed into a demon. Even with the possibility of having to fight seriously with another human they all choose the path to follow, to continue with to fight and protect anyone. However Komaki just isn't happy about their current situation and wants things to return to how they used to be.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"15359","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332781.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Vivendo l'Inferno","synopsis":"Aoi has recently fallen victim to the mysterious coma and now Kyoko Tohno has begun a private investigation of her own. Even at Sakuragaoka Central Hospital there isn't much that can be done for Aoi and the only way to save Aoi, from the clutches of the person's thoughts, is to stop the one who's casting the spell. The connection between all the coma victims is that they all went to the same private middle school, however why is Aoi chosen when she had nothing to do with it? Kyoko Tohno has discovered something important about the comas, who is doing them and why.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"15356","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332782.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"L'orda indemoniata","synopsis":"After what happened over the summer break Hisui Kisaragi is recovering from his injuries after his encounter with Tendo. Aoi is worried after not seeing or hearing from him in a while and even Kyouichi has noticed something different in her. Aoi begins to reminisce of her past, with Hisui. Hisui finally makes his appearance but just to tell the gang some worrying news about the revival of Kidoushuu.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"15368","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332783.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"La donna vuota","synopsis":"The demon seal of the 5-coloured shrines has been broken and even the 8-Hand Sword that Kisaragi protects was unleashed and stolen by the Kidoushuu. Despite these recent events the gang have been busy lately battling demons and training whenever they’re free however there still seems to be a rise in deaths in the area. The one who’s committing all the recent crimes is after Sakurai for some reason and Tatsuma also has someone with a personal vendetta against him.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"15361","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332784.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"Con forza e tenerezza","synopsis":"With exams coming up for all the seniors it’s time for Sakurai to retire from being the archery club Captain however she has other things on her mind as she is still tormented by what happened the other day. Daigo feels unable to get Sakurai out of her depressed state, which makes him feel useless, unable to protect the one he loves. Tatsuma and Kyouichi have to find a way to get everyone back to how they used to be. Later Tendo finds out something to do with Aoi and it may have to be about the “Bodhisattva Eye”.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"15364","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80014/332785.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"it-IT"},"tvdb":{"title":"L'occhio di Bodhisattva","synopsis":"All the incidents involving demons have suddenly stopped after what occurred last month and this may to do with Aoi’s latent power that Tendou Kodzunu has found an interest in; the \"Bodhisattva Eye\". Meanwhile Tatsuma appears to have been dating a girl recently and it happens to be the girl whose parents were killed in the crow incident. These two aren’t the only ones keeping secrets, as Hisui has something that he must do now that he knows the truth, something he’s destined to do.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4799","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1860","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"34726","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80014","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"15365","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una